# Base URL of the PHP API.
#
# Local dev  : leave UNSET -> '/api' is proxied to http://127.0.0.1:8000 by Vite.
#
# Production : ALSO leave UNSET. On Vercel, /api/* is proxied to your tunneled
#              XAMPP backend by vercel.json (same-origin -> no CORS, and the PHP
#              session cookie becomes first-party). Change the tunnel URL in
#              vercel.json, NOT here.
#
# Alternative (direct, cross-origin): set VITE_API_BASE to the tunnel origin so
# the app calls it directly — but then the backend must add credentialed CORS
# (exact origin + Access-Control-Allow-Credentials) and SameSite=None;Secure
# cookies, and modern browsers may still block the third-party cookie.
#
# VITE_API_BASE=
